 "page": [
  {
   "kind": "town",
   "label": "town",
   "section": "header",
   "text": "Spitzplatz · town · germanic · threat frontier · route road · terrain river · seed render-town"
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-HK-1",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "plot_hooks.framing",
   "pool": "category npc: the people are the opening",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Spitzplatz's open questions sit with particular people rather than with offices, which is what makes them approachable.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-HK-1",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "plot_hooks.framing",
   "pool": "category economics: the books are the opening",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Spitzplatz is short of something specific, and being short of something specific is the most tractable kind of difficulty a town can have.",
   "vid": 2
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-HK-1",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "plot_hooks.framing",
   "pool": "category faction: the blocs are the opening",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Nothing in Spitzplatz gets decided by one person, which means everything in Spitzplatz can be influenced.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-HK-1",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "plot_hooks.framing",
   "pool": "category history: the past is the opening",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Spitzplatz has business with its own past that has not finished, and the unfinished parts are on the record rather than in dispute.",
   "vid": 0
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-HK-1",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "plot_hooks.framing",
   "pool": "category tension: the standing quarrels are the opening",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Spitzplatz's difficulties are recorded, chronic and unresolved, which is a different opportunity from a crisis.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-HK-1",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "plot_hooks.framing",
   "pool": "category relationship: the ties are the opening",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Spitzplatz's ties are dense enough that a favour asked of one person reaches three, and everyone here knows which three.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-HK-1",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "plot_hooks.framing",
   "pool": "clock smuggling_rise",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Spitzplatz's revenue depends on trade passing where it can be counted, and less of it is passing there.",
   "vid": 2
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A spy they turned is now being turned back, and feeding information in both directions."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "economics",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Settlement is starving. Desperate villagers might turn to banditry, or a merchant offers to supply food... at a terrible price (debt servitude? dark pact?)."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "They've been meeting privately with someone from outside the settlement whose identity they won't disclose."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "They received a deposition in a civil case that, if acted on, would be correct, and would ruin someone they need."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "faction",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A neutral figure is being pressured by both The Governing Council and The Order of the Watch to take a side before the next council session."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "faction",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Evidence has surfaced suggesting a third party is deliberately escalating the tension between the two factions."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "history",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Old records suggest a series of 'accidents' targeting newcomers is being attributed to chance"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "history",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "An archivist's notes from that period reveal the newcomers fled something, and that something has sent agents after them"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "history",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "An anti-magic agitator is secretly using magic themselves"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "tension",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "The evidence that convicted the heretic was fabricated, and a witness is finally willing to say so"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "tension",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "The condemned doctrine is quietly practised still, by more of the town's leaders than would admit it"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "tension",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A relic seized during the trial never reached the temple vault it was bound for"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "tension",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A collaborator family's wartime fortune was built on betrayals that are finally surfacing"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "tension",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Resistance fighters kept records that would expose people still in power"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "tension",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A former occupier officer has returned under a false identity"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A decision coming in the next season will advantage one significantly. The other knows this."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A document each believed only they possessed has surfaced in a third set of hands."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A third party has learned what the original favour was. The debt just changed hands."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A younger relative has begun trading on the connection both of them refuse to use."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Nanthild Huber has begun to act like someone who considers the debt paid. Hans Fischbach does not."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Mechthild Wolf has begun to act like someone who considers the debt paid. Liutbirg Krüger does not."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Berchta Schmidt is about to call it in."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A third party has asked Berchta Schmidt, quietly, whether Liutbirg Krüger can be trusted. The answer took too long."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Karl Berger is about to call it in."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A third party is actively working to change that calculation."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "relationship",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "A mutual patron has let it be known there is room for only one of them at the next table."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "They received a directive from the hierarchy that contradicts their own theology. Compliance is expected."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "They have been asked to perform a ceremony they have theological objections to. The person asking has leverage."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Someone is paying their soldiers more than their salary. The soldiers aren't saying who."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "One of their most reliable suppliers has gone dark. The goods are still arriving. Someone else is sending them."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "Someone is buying up their debts. Quietly. They don't know who, or why, or when they plan to call them in."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "npc",
   "section": "hooks",
   "text": "They found something hidden in a place it shouldn't be. They put it back. They haven't told anyone."
  }
 ],
